<title>ESTONIA: CONSTRUCTION PRICE INDEX RISES 1.9 PCT Q1.</title>
<headline>CONSTRUCTION PRICE INDEX RISES 1.9 PCT Q1.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's construction price index rose 1.9 percent in the first quarter compared to a 2.0 percent increase in the fourth quarter of last year, the statistics office said on Monday.</p>
<p>The construction price index rose 12.5 percent year-on-year in the first quarter compared to a 22.6 percent year-on-year rise in the same period last year, the office said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 840 6300 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
